BrandSignalsService
BrandSignalsService (owner, 2026-11-16)
Brand awareness (how visible and mentioned the brand is), Reputation (reviews and public comment) and Customer approvals (how customers approve of the brand and its offers), each read from public sources with cited cards. PULSE keeps each week's measures, so a shift against the account's own earlier weeks can be turned into a campaign PROPOSAL a person accepts or dismisses in Campaigns. Nothing is published or sent. Reviews are themes, never people.
