  // Why it failed: voice_disabled, voice_key_unreadable, voice_unauthorized,
  // voice_unreachable, voice_bad_reply, voice_failed, no_script,
  // script_too_long, daily_limit, storage_failed, interrupted.
  string reason_code = 3;
  // Length in seconds (ready only).
  double seconds = 4;
}

ImageService
ImageService
Create still images for your content from a short description. Every image is a draft that carries an "AI-generated" label; nothing is published or attached to a send until a person approves it. Only a person asks for an image (an automated run never does), and only an editor or administrator.
pulse.v1.ImageService, declared in image.proto.



Method
Request → Response
Least role
Notes




GetImageStatus
GetImageStatusRequest → ImageStatus
viewer
Whether image creation is available to the caller's account and why not (reader).


SetImageSettings
SetImageSettingsRequest → ImageStatus
editor
Turn image creation on or off for the caller's account (editor or administrator, a person only).


GenerateImage
GenerateImageRequest → ImageJob
editor
Ask for one to four images from a description (editor or administrator, a person only).


GetImageJob
GetImageJobRequest → ImageJob
viewer
Read a request and its progress (reader).


